      "id": "wr-want-case-stream",
      "what": "The case stream itself. This connector reads app exports, CSV exports and pasted group-chat sync codes, and none has been handed over, so the twin currently models wildlife entirely from its own ecology pack and knows nothing about a single real rescue.",
